[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
The purpose of this document is to outline the design specifications of the Heracles HVPS Interface
Application Firmware.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Scope

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
This document describes the design modules and sub-modules of the Heracles HVPS Interface
Application Firmware.
The information in this document is derived from the HVPS Interface Application FW SRS, referenced in
this document.

\*The term Software applies to both Software and Firmware components.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Abbreviations and Definitions

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
FW
  Firmware

MCU
  Microcontroller Unit

PRS
  Product Requirements Specification

SDP
  Software Development Plan

SRS
  Software Requirements Specification

SW
  Software
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Overview

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
The HVPS interface application firmware is used to control and receive feedback from HVPS.
The HVPS interface application firmware reports data back to and receives commands from the main
control application firmware. The HVPS interface application firmware contains routines to ramp up the
filament current, as well as the high voltage. It contains a proportional-integral feedback
controller for regulating the emission output to a given setpoint.
The HVPS interface application firmware runs on the MCU of the HVPS interface board.
Application setup and cyclic processing run in the default FreeRTOS task. External ADC result processing and feedback-control calculations run in a separate FreeRTOS control task.
<<<

